    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70004" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεβρός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>young of the deer, fawn,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.248
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.336
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέδιλα νεβρῶν</span>
			<i>fawn</i>skin brogues, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.75
			</span></i>; a type of cowardice, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.243
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				21.29
			</span></i>; prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ν. τὸν λέοντα</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱρεῖ</span>), of anything strange,
				<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMort.</u>
				8.1
			</span></i>:—also fem., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.243
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				866
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
				419
			</span></i>.</div>
